ath=/tmp/cloneclone/clone2\u003e \nupdate(ok): . (dataset)\n(datalad3-dev) mih@meiner /tmp/cloneclone % datalad get -d clone2 clone2/file1\nget(ok): file1 (file) [from src...]\n```\n\nIf we start inheriting any configured remote (or just `origin`?), we need to come up with a reliable naming scheme. If we inherit more than just `origin`, we need to come up with a way to deal with build-up of cruft (chains of clones will quickly turn into a long list of remotes that will slow some operations). And we will also have to anticipate and prevent recursive self-references.\n\nAlso, I don't see why we should limit such a feature to local clones.","files":null},{"type":5,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1576398339,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDI4ODM4Mzc5NzM="},"added":["enhancement"],"removed":[]},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1577523360,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU2OTM5OTU0OQ==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/3926#issuecomment-569399549"},"message":"I will look into this feature addition as part of #3966","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1577626150,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU2OTUwNTY5OQ==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/3926#issuecomment-569505699"},"message":"An implementation of this feature is now available in https://github.com/datalad/datalad/pull/3966 Please have a look.","files":null},{"type":5,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1577626162,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDI5MTI0OTIxMTk="},"added":["fix-implemented"],"removed":[]},{"type":4,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1578722487,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50Mjk0MDQxOTc1Mg=="},"status":2}]}